# POC-VMS-32 offline test audit

- [ ] Frozen gold trajectory passes the strict parser and every source span hashes exact raw bytes.
- [ ] Normalizer input differs from gold in exactly the three preregistered semantic fields.
- [ ] Auditor pack contains a real revisit and a single-parent non-MERGE decoy.
- [ ] Dedicated Devin config contains no org ID and disables subagents.
- [ ] Gold/expected-named files are rejected before process launch.
- [ ] Fake carrier proves one-shot argv, export parsing, append-once receipt, and no resume/continue.
- [ ] ATIF-v1.7 counts top-level steps and actual tool calls exactly once; tool_call_id is not a second event.
- [ ] Evaluator golden and fake-merge negative tests both pass.
